          line-height: 16px;
          font-size: 16px;
        "
      >
        <strong>The Cookout!</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">The Cookout! at 25hours Hotel Dubai blends Caribbean BBQ, Jamaican flavours by Miss Lily’s, DJ Crownprince’s old-school hits, and games like Jenga, UNO, and dominoes in a lively afternoon-to-evening social experience.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">
              📅 <strong>When:</strong> <a
          style="
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #102341;
            color: black;
          "
          href="https://www.visitdubai.com/en/festivals-and-events/dubai-events-calendar/the-cookout-dubai"
          target="_blank"
        >April 11 | Tickets start from AED 105</a>
            </p>
      
    </td>
  </tr>
